    "short_description": "Sail the Aether Isles in this action-adventure game. Fight mythical beasts on land and in the sky, shape your destiny from castaway to Warden, and uncover the secret of the storms.",
    "long_description_html": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME A WARDEN OF THE ISLES</h2>Forge your own path across the Aether Isles, a chain of floating islands on the brink of collapse, and rise from stranded castaway to legendary Warden. Fight mythical beasts with sword, bow and storm magic, and lead skirmishes where dozens of allies clash with the Hollow Legion.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://cdn.example.com/steam/apps/999999999/extras/clip-one.poster.avif?t=1700000000\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://cdn.example.com/steam/apps/999999999/extras/clip-one.webm?t=1700000000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://cdn.example.com/steam/apps/999999999/extras/clip-one.mp4?t=1700000000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A LIVING SKY</h2>Sail a skyship between drifting islands, climb ruined observatories, and uncover the history of a civilization that learned to bend the wind. Every island has its own weather, wildlife and secrets to map.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://cdn.example.com/steam/apps/999999999/extras/clip-two.poster.avif?t=1700000000\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://cdn.example.com/steam/apps/999999999/extras/clip-two.webm?t=1700000000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://cdn.example.com/steam/apps/999999999/extras/clip-two.mp4?t=1700000000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE WHO YOU BECOME</h2>Your choices shape the Isles. Broker peace between rival guilds or play them against each other, recruit companions with their own agendas, and tune your gear, ship and abilities to the Warden you want to be.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://cdn.example.com/steam/apps/999999999/extras/clip-three.poster.avif?t=1700000000\" width=600 height=344 